      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4 leading-tight">{title}</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-6">
        For decades, intensive one-to-one therapy was considered the mandatory gold standard for autism interventions. Landmark research published in <em>Behavioral Interventions</em> reveals why small-group teaching is not only equally effective, but often essential for real-world school success.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-600 border-b pb-6 mb-6">
        <span>Estimated reading time: 8 min</span>
        <span>&bull;</span>
        <span>Peer-Reviewed Study Reference: Leaf et al. (2013)</span>
        <span>&bull;</span>
        <span>Updated: {new Date(lastUpdated).toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'short', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mb-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
